    questFailed: "You didn\u2019t find the witch today. Your tail hangs a little
      lower on your way back into town. Hopefully he won\u2019t get mad at the knight.
      The knight isn\u2019t well enough to be taken to court... again."
    questWon: "You\u2019re not sure what to think. You knew that the knight and the
      witch don\u2019t like each other anymore, but you never thought that the witch
      could do something like this. You whine, thinking about when the three of you
      still got along."
