    questCompleted: 0
    conditionsMet: 0
    questFailed: When the baker sees you on the way out of the forest, her face suddenly
      goes very red. She insists you forget about your secret meeting. You tilt your
      head as the baker stumbles away, calling herself silly under her breath.
    questWon: The first thing you do when you get back into town is tug the baker
      by the apron back to the knight. They talk for two hours, and you get to lay
      between two of your favourite people getting many belly rubs. The knight seems
      to be in higher spirits!
