    questCompleted: 0
    conditionsMet: 0
    questFailed: You enter the bakery with your head and ears hung low. The baker
      isn't mad, but she looks sad when she tells you that, because of how long it
      takes dairy products out to the village, she probably can't make that special
      cheesecake for the knight until next week.
    questWon: "The baker lets you supervise her as she bakes a cheesecake for the
      knight. When you deliver\_it, the knight insists she stays for a slice. The\_baker
      sits on the edge of the knight's bed as they laugh into the evening.\_Your\_begging
      eventually gets rewarded with your own tiny piece."
